                "text": "Today, I spoke on the floor in support of the Fix Our Forests Act. Wildfires are inevitable, but decades of forest mismanagement directly contributed to the severity of the fires we are witnessing, which is why I'm proud to support this bipartisan effort to restore forest health. https://t.co/8KpkmclTeM",
