                "text": "I met with Valley Children's Healthcare this week to discuss H.R. 1, educational programs, and resources to expand access to care in our communities. The work they do to improve child health outcomes in our region is so important, and I look forward to our continued partnership. https://t.co/QeBKpEIKPu",
